  "spec": ["foundations 9", "foundations 14.16", "foundations 14.17"],
  "description": "Variant encoding (§9.2): every worked example of §9.3 encodes to its bytes and reads back; every readable disk tag round-trips, arrays of length 0 included; a Bool byte 02 reads as true. Failures: VoidPtr writes marker and tag and then fails with a sticky error (also VoidPtr and IGZUnknown arrays); Char / RZUnicodeChar scalars are written but tags 0x11 and 0x10 do not read; unknown tags fail; marker 1 reads like 0; a null object leaves a pre-set Uint32 unchanged; a UTF-16 string header reads as UTF-8.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "variant_write", "variant": {"type": "u32", "value": 7}, "hex": "00000000 03000000 07000000"},
    {"op": "variant_write", "variant": {"type": "f32", "value": 6.0}, "hex": "00000000 09000000 0000c040"},
    {"op": "variant_write", "variant": {"type": "i64", "value": 50}, "hex": "00000000 08000000 3200000000000000"},
    {"op": "variant_write", "variant": {"type": "bool", "value": true}, "hex": "00000000 0b000000 01"},
    {"op": "variant_write", "variant": {"type": "u16[]", "values": [92, 595]}, "hex": "00000000 02800000 02000000 5c005302"},
    {"op": "variant_write", "variant": {"type": "f32[]", "values": [100.0]}, "hex": "00000000 09800000 01000000 0000c842"},
    {"op": "variant_write", "variant": {"type": "string", "value": "Abc"}, "hex": "00000000 0c800000 03000000 416263"},
    {"op": "variant_write", "variant": {"type": "empty"}, "hex": "00000000 00000000"},
    {"op": "variant_write", "variant": {"type": "object"}, "hex": "ace9bea9 00000000", "round_trip": false,
